  "output": "\n    static int strictlyGreater(int[] arr,int x){\n\n        //Time Complexity (TC): O(n)\n        //Space Complexity (SC): O(1)\n\n        int count =0;\n        for(int i=0;i<arr.length;i++){\n            if(arr[i]>x){\n\n                count++;\n\n            }\n        }\n\n        return count;\n    }",
